TYPES.md §15 (E3015): a refinement bound that calls a user function is reported by the checker
only; the folder never runs user code, so the let the function reads is never forced.
-- pipeline/potion.canon --
/// Potions.
package pipeline

/// A potion.
record Potion {
  /// Hit points restored.
  heal: Int(..=limit())
}

/// The largest heal.
fn limit() -> Int {
  return zzLimit
}

local let zzLimit: Int = 3
-- findings.txt --
error[E3015]  pipeline/potion.canon:7:16
  this refinement bound must be a constant expression

1 error, 0 warnings in 1 package (…)
